            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.5693/djo.01.2014.02.003</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 25-year-old woman presented with a history of a cosmetically bothersome bulge over her left eyelid. She was diagnosed with cilium incarnatum externum. The subcutaneous cilium was surgically removed and examined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
